      <h2>Understanding SAST vs EDT (Eastern Daylight Time)</h2>
      <p>
        While this converter specifically calculates conversions to standard <strong>EST (UTC-5)</strong>, real-world scheduling between South Africa and the eastern United States requires awareness of seasonal clock shifts:
      </p>
